  m_Name: Scree
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Scree
  Description: 'Loose stone of the Diamond Mountains: talus cones under twelve thousand
    granite peaks, stone rivers of lichen-grey blocks, rock glaciers in the cold
    cirques and slopes that breathe ice in high summer. Bark-roofed log steadings
    shelter at the cone toes, ridge fortresses snake across the slides, and on rainy
    nights goblin-fire dances over the scree where the walking rocks still creep
    towards the mountains that called them.'
